#. Tag: title
#: man-apper.1.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-apper.1.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "Apper is an interface for PackageKit"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-apper.1.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Apper is able to manage packages, applications and updates in a cross-"
"distribution way thanks to the PackageKit project."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-apper.1.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is providing &Linux; users a single application that they can learn and "
"use in whatever distribution they are."
msgstr ""

